{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 16, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the Land of the Rising Sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Dreams**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive at Narita's gate.\nA taxi swift shall carry thee to Shinjuku's estate.\nThere lodge thou in a hotel of modern grace.\nThen wander forth to see this bustling place.\nThe Shinjuku Gyoen a garden serene and fair.\nA feast for eyes a tranquil atmosphere.\nDinner awaits in a ramen shop so bold.\nStories untold in flavors of old.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Temples and Trendy Ways**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple Sensoji we go.\nIncense ascends a fragrant flow.\nExplore Nakamise-dori a market bright.\nWith trinkets and treats a wondrous sight.\nThen Shibuya's crossing a spectacle grand.\nA sea of souls a shifting strand.\nHarajuku's fashion a vibrant hue.\nYouthful spirits forever new.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Embrace**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's vale.\nWhere Mount Fuji's peak doth prevail.\nCruise on Lake Ashi a vista sublime.\nNature's artistry defying time.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum a joyful art.\nSculptures and landscapes a brand new start.\nReturn to Tokyo as twilight descends.\nWhere evening's charm gently transcends.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Splendor**\n\nBy bullet train to Kyoto we haste.\nA city of history a venerable taste.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream.\nThousands of torii a radiant gleam.\nKiyomizu-dera temple a wooden grace.\nPanoramic views of this hallowed place.\nGion's geishas a fleeting sight.\nMysteries veiled in the fading light.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Gardens and Golden Pavilion**\n\nRyoan-ji's garden a zen delight.\nFifteen stones arranged in perfect might.\nKinkaku-ji's pavilion a gilded show.\nReflecting beauty in waters below.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant maze.\nSunlight dappled in a hazy daze.\nA tea ceremony a ritual deep.\nWhere ancient customs softly sleep.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey a city of deer.\nThey bow to visitors banishing fear.\nTodai-ji temple houses a Buddha grand.\nA marvel of scale throughout the land.\nKasuga Taisha Shrine lanterns abound.\nA mystical atmosphere all around.\nReturn to Kyoto as day is done.\nBeneath the stars a journey spun.\n\n**Day Seven: Farewell Japan a Heart Full of Grace**\n\nFrom Kyoto's embrace we bid adieu.\nTo Japan's wonders forever true.\nDepart from Kansai's airport with grateful heart.\nMemories cherished a work of art.\nMay thy journey be filled with delight.\nAnd dreams of Japan ever so bright.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.009764053858816624}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5308548808097839}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.8752150535583496}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0012949660886079073}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.07767640799283981}, {"token": "▁Land", "logprob": -0.23192541301250458}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.035795919597148895}, {"token": "▁Rising", "logprob": -3.576272320060525e-06}, {"token": "▁Sun", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.04167841002345085}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.09902025759220123}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.036690469831228256}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.20480482280254364}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.18327650427818298}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.009259731508791447}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.7052378058433533}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.6389068961143494}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.007417519111186266}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.003544003702700138}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.08046751469373703}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.002041638595983386}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -6.794906312279636e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0027887048199772835}, {"